Scope: Responses tool-stream reasoning transport only
Purpose: 0005 opened the Responses reasoning item from backend-classified
  ChatDelta reasoning on the no-tools stream path. The tool-calling stream
  path still gated the item on the Go-side tag extractor, so a backend that
  classifies reasoning itself (ChatDelta.reasoning_content) produced a
  function_call item without the preceding reasoning item. Apply the same gate
  to the tool-stream path so reasoning is emitted before the function call.
Unmodified: backend.proto, tool grammar body, sampling, model loading,
  reasoning extraction, response envelope.
Note: ordering only; the backend remains the source of truth for reasoning.

Apply inside a LocalAI v4.10.0 source checkout from its root, after 0001..0005:
  git apply vendor/localai/patches/0006-responses-reasoning-tools-stream.patch

